 <main id="main" class="wrap"><h1>About Market Radar</h1><section class="card"><p>Market Radar is a lightweight, no-clutter site for key global and Iranian market prices. No accounts, no ads, no tracking — the whole site is under one megabyte.</p><p>Data is automatically fetched from public sources, validated and published as static files roughly every 4 hours. Each value shows its source and update time. If a fetch fails, the last known good data is kept.</p><p>Implied USD is a calculated rate: the ratio of domestic gold prices to the USD value of global gold, adjusted for purity and weight. It can differ significantly from official or free-market rates.</p><p><strong>Data is for information only and is not investment advice.</strong> data is for information only and is not investment advice. Accuracy is not guaranteed.</p></section></main>
